  "_about": "GT3 race dash on the 1920x720 cluster, generated by design/gen_gt3.py (edit that and regenerate). Black covers BMW's gauges; while the Waze map shows inside the theme ('Show Waze map inside the theme', toggle 'mapUp'), 'hole' cuts the map window out of it over the map, inset 'holeInset' px with 'holeRadius' corners (tune in a copy pushed to <data>/layouts/gt3.json, scripts/deploy.sh). The background and every framed box are one effect layer ('boxes'); with the lights and one rev bar that is 3 effect layers, since the car draws only a few. Everything ends 16 px over BMW's own bottom strip (y 662), which shows under the theme (the frame stops at y 660; the right column's bottom slot is the fuel level now, not the clock BMW's strip already has), the drive mode sits on the gear's header, and keeps 10 px clear of the hood's curve over the top corners and of the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
